<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila now heads a rebel coalition that includes M23, which has seized positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting with Congolese government forces, while the United States has sanctioned Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama and is moving to remove Rwanda and South Africa from the AGOA duty-free trade programme. An Ebola outbreak in eastern DR Congo has killed more than 5,300 people, prompting WHO warnings of a continent-wide spread, and a UK doctor contracted Ebola while fighting the outbreak. The Allied Democratic Forces returned to Lubero, spreading fear amid the Ebola crisis, and rescued 29 hostiles from ADF extremists. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQTEc3VWRicmFISXlSQWxkVWhYYWM1ZTBfNk9HMVpNaFV3dlpveDFfRWNFWHBTT1Z5TW1pUF8tLU9OUkNaNmFnMUZ0ajFQaEZjTUpsY21KemJzRlBhTjdGWFlSbEU4QURwMEFFMUVkNlZrM2NtOVNZV0FRV0xlWm4zeXFqbXZoZENiRk9ITlVzNm_SAZYBQVVfeXFMT3QzSDNZNGhnSU5WVG1pdDc4OU42YXNoWGhRYm9Mc1NlcG5ENkttMlBCMnE3UURaaGxqREhxai1lMk5XbVlWRUZYM2MtdS1lUDhTSXJLVW9lUEpnYTZWd0RUUWZDODc0TEw4NEtheE9vMGx1SmNBVG1TTlpLaFctUzBKQ25wemY0NnlmdFNHb2JKWjQ3eVVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE12QWlHTTk4T010X1NOeVFiNmJLR011RDJ4ZTY2UTVMVENCemd5M2FIRWxHUmRnN2Z1M3BVTWVyQThUczQwSmxEMHhzZnpLNURSMXpvOFF4S09YTTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPRi1Fa241d0c3dDVLSzA2UklQWF9CUjB6QnRzejRfV0hmRUF5bVJxU1RsSzNWUU1xSTkwVHpUM2xUWDFqNlV5XzNoSDFrbWplcWEtUm9RMkphMmdETy05OVFLdTZXZk5XeU9tSlBMZjlhMmZ2VFU3czZ2V2JaOVpxSVdUaVNlUjZUeXZYdmxtVjhvNHFv?oc=5&quot;&gt;International Christian Concern&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a 